{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>If his wife goes astray.</b> She departs from the ways of modesty." "<b>And commits treachery against him.</b> She profaned the holiness of HaShem that he loved in the sanctity of personhood — through embracing and kissing a man other than her husband and their like (Malachi 2:11)."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {1 "קדש ה׳ rendered 'the holiness of HaShem'; קידושי אישות rendered 'sanctity of personhood,' i.e., the sanctity of the marital bond; ודומיהם rendered 'and their like.'"}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:43.782441568Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}